@@ -3,3 +3,28 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()`, exported from `src/index.ts`, keeps equipment and bookings in memory:
+
+```ts
+const service = createRentalService();
+service.addEquipment({ id: 'board-1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 1500 });
+
+const quote = service.quote({ itemId: 'board-1', start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z', end: '2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z' });
+// quote.total === 3000
+
+const booking = service.book({ itemId: 'board-1', start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z', end: '2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z' });
+```
+
+Rules that apply throughout:
+
+- Money is an integer number of euro cents.
+- Times are UTC, written as ISO-8601 strings.
+- A booking covers whole days only: a period starts and ends at midnight UTC, and it ends at the start
+  of the day after its last day.
+- The same item cannot be booked twice for overlapping periods.
+
+`quote` and `book` throw for an unknown item or a period the rules above do not allow; `book` also throws
+when the item is not free for the whole period. Cancellation is not implemented yet.
